head (
# Nightmares of Newbord Manor ((Nightmares of Newbord Manor))

In Nightmares of Newborn Manor, adventurers must brave a haunted estate where the echoes of infant cries twist into sinister omens. Once a proud home, the manor now groans under the weight of sleepless terrors, spectral toys, and cursed relics of parenthood. To survive, heroes must face the trials of endless diapers, bottle-born horrors, and lullabies that lull the soul toward doom. Only through courage—and perhaps a bit of humor—can the party escape the cradle of despair.
-
)

![module_cover](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gsimon2/nightmares-of-newborn-maner/b999ed03f8767ac5b10ee17b6f3d0c90362985f1/images/world-backdrop.png)


/
