head(
## The Hallway of Heavy Eyes ((+ The Hallway of Heavy Eyes))
)

/


/

The hallway stretches ahead in uneasy silence, its tiled floor marked by faint shuffling tracks — the kind left by someone barely awake, dragging their feet through exhaustion rather than intent.  
Three paintings hang along the walls, crooked and dim beneath the flickering light.  

It feels like a place someone once stumbled through countless times in the dead of night — searching for the source of a cry, too tired to remember why.  

A cool draft slides down the corridor, carrying with it the faint scent of baby powder and something else — faintly sour, faintly sweet.  
The hush of the hallway presses in around you, and every creak of the floorboards feels like a heartbeat waiting for its next breath.

|

rules (
## Investigation
Players may examine each painting freely.  

**DC 18** — Identify the wondrous item depicted.  

**DC 23** — Learn about its location within the manor.  


Encourage roleplay with different **Recall Knowledge** skills such as **Arcana**, **Religion**, or **Occultism**, depending on the tone of their interpretation.
)

note (
## GM Notes
Each painting hints at a **wondrous item** hidden elsewhere in the manor.  
If the players already possess one of the depicted items, the painting of that item subtly glows when they enter the hallway.
)

/

### Painting 1 — *“The Nourishing Light”*
A rosy-cheeked baby smiles up from a field of clouds, cradling a bottle full of milk.  
Light dances across the painting, giving the illusion that the milk truly shimmers with life.  
*(Depicts the **Bottle of Endless Milk** — located in the Nursery.)*

---

### Painting 2 — *“The Blanket of Peace”*
A sleeping infant is wrapped snugly in a soft pastel blanket, surrounded by stars that seem to glow with gentle warmth.  
The baby’s tiny hand peeks out, grasping one glowing corner as a peaceful smile graces its face.  
*(Depicts the **Blanket of Soothing Snuggles** — located in the Laundry Room.)*

---

### Painting 3 — *“The Joy of the Bath”*
A laughing baby splashes happily in a porcelain tub filled with frothy bubbles, clutching a bright yellow rubber duck mid-squeak.  
Sunlight streams through an unseen window, casting the whole scene in a cozy golden glow.  
*(Depicts the **Rubber Ducky of Bubbleguard** — located in the Bathroom.)*

/





