**Critical Failure:** A knife or spoon lashes out in irritation, dealing **1d4 slashing or bludgeoning damage** to the offending player.
)

note (
## GM Notes
Describe the kitchen as simultaneously miraculous and horrifying — a place of divine service turned mindless.  
The utensils occasionally “sigh” or clatter in protest, showing exhaustion even in enchantment.  
If the players linger too long, describe dishes vanishing and reappearing in new configurations, as though the kitchen itself is testing new recipes endlessly in search of satisfaction.
)


