| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Hunger** | Bottle of Endless Milk | All players are **Drained 1** | Offering the bottle fills the air with a warm scent of milk. The hunger subsides. |
| **Cravings** | Snack of Everlasting Crumbs | All players are **Enfeebled 1** | Presenting the snack releases golden crumbs that fade into light. The craving quiets. |
| **Filth** | Diaper of Doom Containment | All players are **Sickened 1** | Once placed, the air clears — a divine cleansing fills the room. |
| **Anger / Restlessness** | Blanket of Soothing Snuggles | All players are **Frightened 1** | Draping the blanket over the throne dulls the heat and steadies the cries. |
| **Upset / Crying** | Pacifier of Blessed Silence | All players are **Stupefied 1** | Placing the pacifier in the baby’s mouth hushes the room. The wails fade to whimpers. |






